      "translation_input": "Sur un plateau difficile d'accès, une station alimente un dispensaire un relais radio, des instruments météorologiques et l'éclairage de sécurité Le micro-réseau réunit des panneaux solaires, des batteries au lithium et un petit générateur diesel. Comme la route peut rester fermée plusieurs jours, un contrôleur mesure la tension, le courant, la température et les vibrations toutes les 200 millisecondes. Les données détaillées restent sur place; seul un résumé compressé est transmis lorsque la liaison fonctionne Les équipements médicaux et de communication sont prioritaires",
      "translated_text": "On a hard-to-reach plateau, a station feeds a clinic with a radio relay, weather instruments and safety lighting The micro-grid includes solar panels, lithium batteries and a small diesel generator. Since the road can remain closed for days, a controller measures voltage, current, temperature and vibration every 200 milliseconds. Detailed data remains in place; only a compressed summary is transmitted when the link is operational Medical and communication equipment is a priority",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "spoken_text": "On a hard-to-reach plateau, a station feeds a clinic with a radio relay, weather instruments and safety lighting The micro-grid includes solar panels, lithium batteries and a small diesel generator. Since the road can remain closed for days, a controller measures voltage, current, temperature and vibration every 200 milliseconds. Detailed data remains in place; only a compressed summary is transmitted when the link is operational Medical and communication equipment is a priority",
      "spell_changes": []
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "region_id": 3,
