      "translation_chunk_count": 3,
      "translation_input": "Le 18 octobre 2025, une tempête de poussière a réduit la production solaire de 34 % en quinze minutes. La température de l'armoire de batteries a augmenté de 8 °C, tandis que le ventilateur de l'onduleur produisait une vibration anormale Au lieu d'arrêter la station, le système a coupé le chauffage secondaire, réduit certains éclairages et démarré le groupe de secours. Il a identifié trois causes possibles des débris sur les panneaux, un roulement usé et une résistance croissante dans un connecteur de batterie",
      "translated_text": "On October 18, 2025, a dust storm reduced solar output by 34 percent in fifteen minutes. The temperature of the battery cabinet rose by 8°C, while the inverter fan produced an abnormal vibration. Instead of shutting down the station, the system turned off the secondary heating, reduced some of the lighting and started the rescue group. He identified three possible causes of debris on the panels, a worn-out bearing and increasing resistance in a battery connector.",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "spoken_text": "On October 18, 2025, a dust storm reduced solar output by 34 percent in fifteen minutes. The temperature of the battery cabinet rose by 8°C, while the inverter fan produced an abnormal vibration. Instead of shutting down the station, the system turned off the secondary heating, reduced some of the lighting and started the rescue group. He identified three possible causes of debris on the panels, a worn-out bearing and increasing resistance in a battery connector.",
      "spell_changes": []
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "region_id": 4,
